physicalRef: warehouse_scan/database
description: "Logistics cargo theft Link Analysis showcase - One row per barcode scan of a shipment at a warehouse: inbound (received at the origin), putaway, outbound (loaded onto the truck) and arrived (received at the destination), when, and the employee whose handheld scanned it (blank for a few). One file per month of departure (WAREHOUSE_SCAN_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the warehouse_scan Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: scanned_at
columns[5]{name,type,classification}:
  shipment_id,string,
  warehouse_id,string,
  scan_type,string,
  scanned_at,timestamp,
  employee_id,string,
